    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to negotiate an invitation and explain a tactful response.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U6-02-skill-K-HSK6-interact-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "HSK 6: interact",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Mediation requires understanding each participant’s concern and the actual request. Check an ambiguous point, propose a response that addresses both concerns and confirm the remaining disagreement.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "场合",
                "pinyin": "chǎnghé",
                "meaning": "occasion; setting",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "54dc6e85e526b298b83e398410753c3f4b75d9896e64d879a022771c1f591d94"
              },
              {
                "text": "称呼",
                "pinyin": "chēnghu",
                "meaning": "to call; to address as",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "4d72ffab712b428e2e7fdf34868760b6fcb2412fa0b2f3e83ed36190ff8527b5"
              },
              {
                "text": "求助",
                "pinyin": "qiúzhù",
                "meaning": "to request help; to appeal",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "c8722da1c83727fd790db63dace64e39b2e233d1695dc096443d17ae46932a57"
              },
              {
                "text": "解释",
                "pinyin": "jiěshì",
                "meaning": "explanation; to explain",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "2d202d6139a0dbc55380c48084f1f620514247c225fa7f5e5117666a8af418ba"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A asks a companion to explain a message today, worrying that an unanswered message will be misunderstood. B worries that the task may require knowledge they lack and has not agreed. It is unclear which part needs explaining. Clarify the request, restate both concerns, and propose checking that part first; no agreement to complete the whole task exists.\nFamiliar meanings available: occasion; setting; to call; to address as; to request help; to appeal; explanation; to explain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U6-02-skill-K-HSK6-interact-perform",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Use the skill in context",
        "questions": [
